  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Open Sensory Space for Uzhgorod Children</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Open Sensory Space for Uzhgorod Children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Cie&#x13e;om mikrograntu je vybudovanie centra pre deti s obmedzen&#xfd;mi komunika&#x10d;n&#xfd;mi schopnos&#x165;ami a jemn&#xfd;mi poruchami motorick&#xfd;ch zru&#x10d;nost&#xed;. Ide o n&#xe1;kup didaktick&#xfd;ch pom&#xf4;cok, pomocou ktor&#xfd;ch bude odborn&#xfd; person&#xe1;l pracova&#x165; s hendikepovan&#xfd;mi de&#x165;mi.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to ensure the equal opportunities and access to education for children with limited communication skills and fine motor skills disorders by opening of the sensory room and by implementation of corrective methods in teaching Uzhgorod children with limited communication skills and fine motor disorders.</narrative>
  </description>
